                <pb facs="0787" n="777" sameAs="frus:frus1919Parisv09/pg777"/>

                <head>Appendix G to HD–121</head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1920-01-02"><hi rendition="#small-caps">January</hi> 2,
                            1920</date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p rendition="#center"><hi rendition="#italic">Note Presented to the Supreme Council
                        by the Drafting Committee</hi></p>
                <p>In four letters, written on the 23rd and 24th of December last, the Czecho-Slovak
                    Delegation asked the Drafting Committee for information as to the interpretation
                    of certain Articles of the Treaty of Saint-Germain.</p>
                <p>The Drafting Committee would be grateful to the Supreme Council for instructions
                    as to whether it is authorized to furnish the Czecho-Slovak Delegation with the
                    interpretative advice solicited, and to act accordingly in analogous cases which
                    might be presented eventually.</p>
                <closer>For the Drafting Committee<lb/><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Henri
                            Fromageot</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
